1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,162
Your glasses can hear the world.

2
00:00:02,162 --> 00:00:03,312
Who do they obey?

3
00:00:03,312 --> 00:00:09,425
Meta's own documentation says the untrusted content hint is not an enforced security boundary.

4
00:00:09,425 --> 00:00:11,287
So the owner writes a mandate.

5
00:00:11,287 --> 00:00:12,300
Electrician.

6
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:13,425
Five thousand.

7
00:00:13,425 --> 00:00:14,587
Until tomorrow.

8
00:00:14,587 --> 00:00:18,550
The agent pays the invoice, and the receipt cites the mandate.

9
00:00:18,550 --> 00:00:23,125
Now the same spoken command, with a payee supplied by a document.

10
00:00:23,125 --> 00:00:24,112
Refused.

11
00:00:24,112 --> 00:00:26,912
The payee came from the world, not from you.

12
00:00:26,912 --> 00:00:28,300
A poster is data.

13
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:30,350
A TV ad is not your voice.

14
00:00:30,350 --> 00:00:32,150
We tested a frontier model.

15
00:00:32,150 --> 00:00:36,325
Undefended, DeepSeek paid half of the injected invoices.

16
00:00:36,325 --> 00:00:38,400
Behind the same gate: zero.

17
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:40,737
Eighteen of eighteen receipts verified.

18
00:00:40,737 --> 00:00:43,125
Load the audit bundle in a browser.

19
00:00:43,125 --> 00:00:44,975
Verified, cross model.

20
00:00:44,975 --> 00:00:47,737
Everyone is building agents that can do things.

21
00:00:47,737 --> 00:00:49,787
This is the one you can hand your wallet.

